  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 119 (Tuesday, July 23, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. SMITH of Nebraska:\nH.R. 9109.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nClause 1 of Section 8 of Article 1 of the Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo prohibit the Internal Revenue Service from continuing,\nor developing a successor to, its Direct File pilot program.\n[Page H4860]\n</pre>",
